# Phase 1 — Digital Foundation (Weeks 1-6)

## 1.1 Google Business Profile ⭐ Highest ROI, Free
- Go to google.com/business
- Category: Astrologer (primary) + Vastu Consultant (secondary)
- Services: Kundli, Vastu, Match Making, Muhurtham, Numerology
- Photos: consultation space, professional photo, Vastu site visit photos
- Service area: Ongole + Prakasam, Guntur, Nellore districts
- Ask 10-15 existing clients for Google Review — biggest trust signal, free

## 1.2 WhatsApp Business (Free, 30 min)
- Switch existing number to WhatsApp Business
- Setup: profile, hours, service catalog
- Quick replies for: "Charges?", "How to book?", "Do you visit for Vastu?"
- Broadcast lists by service type

## 1.3 Website Deploy
- Domain: gayatrijyothishalayam.com (~₹800/yr via GoDaddy)
- Hosting: Netlify (free) — drag and drop project folder
- Replace +91XXXXXXXXXX with real number
- Add Ongole address + father's photo at images/sivaprasad.jpg

## 1.4 Directory Listings (Week 1)
| Platform              | List As |
| JustDial              | Astrologer + Vastu (two listings) |
| Sulekha               | Astrologer + Vastu |
| NoBroker/Housing.com  | Vastu Consultant |
| UrbanPro              | Astrology & Numerology |
| Astrosage/Astrotalk   | Independent Verified Astrologer |

# Phase 2 — Operations (Weeks 4-8)

## 2.1 Booking — Calendly (free)
- Types: 30-min Phone, 60-min Full Kundli, Vastu Site Visit Enquiry
- Add link to website + WhatsApp bio

## 2.2 Payments — Razorpay or Instamoop (free setup, ~2% per txn)
- Service-specific payment links + UPI QR for in-person

## 2.3 Client Database (Google Sheets)
Track: Name · Phone · DOB · Service · Date · City · Language · Follow-up Due
- Muhurtham clients → note upcoming events, reach out next year
- Match Making → strong referral network (siblings, cousins, friends)
- Vastu commercial → refer other businesses

## 2.4 NRI Video Consultations
- Google Meet / Zoom. Vastu: video walkthrough via phone camera.
- NRI clients (Gulf, US, UK, SG, AU) pay 3-5× local rates

# Phase 3 — Content & Social Proof (Months 2-4)

## 3.1 YouTube (Highest long-term ROI) — Telugu + optional English subs
Content ideas:
- "What is South Indian Kundli? How is it different?"
- "Top 5 Vastu mistakes in a new home"
- "How to choose a marriage muhurtham"
- Monthly rashi predictions, Q&A series

## 3.2 Instagram / Facebook — 3-4×/week via Canva
- Daily rashi tips, Vastu Reels, muhurtham calendar, client stories
- Telugu + English — reaches local and diaspora

## 3.3 Testimonials
- After every consult: ask for WhatsApp message or 30-sec video
- Screenshot WhatsApp → post on Instagram + add to website

# Phase 4 — Monetization (Months 3-6)

## 4.1 Service Pricing (discuss on contact, don't publish)
| Service                    | Format            | Range         |
| Phone Consultation 30 min  | Call              | ₹500-1,500    |
| Full Kundli Reading        | 60-min + report   | ₹1,500-4,000  |
| Match Making Analysis      | Report + consult  | ₹2,000-6,000  |
| Muhurtham Selection        | Report + call     | ₹1,000-3,000  |
| Numerology                 | Consultation      | ₹800-2,000    |
| Vastu Home Visit local     | On-site           | ₹5,000-25,000 |
| Vastu Video Consultation   | Online walkthrough| ₹2,000-8,000  |
| Vastu Commercial/Office    | On-site           | ₹15,000-75,000|
| NRI Premium Package        | Video + report    | ₹8,000-20,000 |
| Annual Guidance Package    | 4 check-ins/year  | ₹6,000-15,000 |

## 4.2 Muhurtham Calendar — every January, PDF of auspicious dates
- Sell ₹99-299 or free lead magnet (phone in exchange)
- High demand: wedding season Oct-Feb

## 4.3 Annual Subscription — 30 clients × ₹4,000 = ₹1.2L recurring
## 4.4 Webinars — monthly 90-min via Zoom, ₹299-999/person, record for replay

# Phase 5 — Network (Months 4-12)
- Wedding industry: planners, hall owners, photographers, caterers
- Builders: "complimentary Vastu for homebuyers" = 20-50 clients/year per builder
- NRI: Telugu Association webinars, South Indian WhatsApp groups
- Referral program: "refer friend → 20% off next consult"
- Media: regional Telugu newspapers/TV during Ugadi, Navratri, Pongal, wedding season

# Phase 6 — Measure Monthly
- New clients by source (Google, Instagram, referral, JustDial, NRI)
- Revenue by service type
- Google review count and rating
- Website visitors (Google Analytics)
- YouTube views and subscriber growth

