# 12-Month Vision
- 50+ Google reviews (4.8+ stars) across both profiles
- Website live with booking + WhatsApp integration
- NRI clients 30-40% of revenue
- Builder partnerships for steady Vastu pipeline
- YouTube: 20+ videos on Vastu + South Indian astrology
- Annual packages creating recurring revenue

